// GIFT REACTIONS: BASIC
"Val.GiftReaction.Love": "Wow, I feel like you really thought of me... Thank you, @.$4",
"Val.GiftReaction.Like": "You got this for me? Thanks so much, how sweet of you!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.Dislike": "Different strokes for different folks, huh?$22",
"Val.GiftReaction.Hate": "I'm not sure why you're giving this to me...$24",
"Val.GiftReaction.Neutral": "Thanks for this, it's very kind of you.$20",
// GIFT REACTIONS: GENERAL 
"Val.GiftReaction.Negative": "Erm, no thanks.$27", 
"Val.GiftReaction.Positive": "Thank you, @!$26", 
// GIFT REACTION: STARDROP TEA 
"Val.GiftReaction.StardropTea": "Wow, @! This is amazing! It smells so good, what's it made of? Thank you for sharing this with me.$1",
// GIFT REACTION: RUBY RING 
"Val.GiftReaction.ESRubyRing": "%This doesn't belong to Val...",
// GIFT REACTIONS: CATEGORIES 
"Val.GiftReaction.ArtisanalGoods": "You made this yourself? That's so impressive, thank you.$1", 
"Val.GiftReaction.Minerals": "This is beautiful, @! Minerals are so diverse. Thank you.$1", 
"Val.GiftReaction.Gems": "This is beautiful, @! I love how it catches the light. Thank you.$1", 
"Val.GiftReaction.Dairy": "Farm fresh dairy is such an awesome treat. Thank you, @!", 
"Val.GiftReaction.Fruit": "Did you grow this on your farm? No better treat than fresh fruit. Thank you, @!$1", 
"Val.GiftReaction.Vegetables": "If you're trying to say I don't get enough vegetables in my diet... you're right! Thank you, @.$1", 
"Val.GiftReaction.Flowers": "These are lovely, @! Did you grow them yourself? Thank you for sharing them with me.$1", 
"Val.GiftReaction.Books": "Thank you, @! I'll add this to the collection. I love adding things to my 'to-read' pile. It's forever expanding.$26", 
// GIFT REACTIONS: LOVES 
"Val.GiftReaction.PrismaticShard": "My caretaker, Wyatt, was the last person to give me one of these. When I was old enough, I made a dagger out of it and gave it back. Thank you for this, @.$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.TripleShotEspresso": "What's another three shots on top of the five I've had already today? Thank you, @.$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.PumpkinPie": "Pumpkin tastes so good, I'll eat it in just about anything! Thank you. $1",
"Val.GiftReaction.GoldenPumpkin.false": "You won this...and you're giving it to me Thank you, @. I've got the perfect spot to display it.$25#$action AddMail Current GiftedValGPumpkin received",
"Val.GiftReaction.GoldenPumpkin.true": "Two years in a row? That's very thoughtful of you, @, but I still treasure the first one.[373]",
"Val.GiftReaction.JackOLantern": "This looks fantastic! And you carved it yourself? It looks perfectly spooky, great job!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.NautilusShell": "This is my favorite shell, because it's my favorite color and I love the unique shape. Thank you, @.$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.FairyRose": "This is my favorite flower - I just love how dainty they are, and all the different colors they come in. Thanks, @.$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.MapleBar": "You know, I have really fond memories of getting homemade maple bars with close friends... thanks for the nostalgia, @.$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.CrabCakes": "I hate crabs. They trek sand everywhere, and they're a menace to East Scarp.$6#$b# The only thing they're good for is being served up, just like this. Thanks, @.$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.DinosaurEgg": "I'm flattered you thought of me, but if you aren't already breeding them on your farm, you should start![107]$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.SalishBourbon": "Nothing is better than bourbon, neat, on a cool evening after a productive day...$4",
"Val.GiftReaction.DinerCoffee": "Now THIS is a damn fine cup of coffee!$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.CherryPie": "Now THIS is a damn fine slice of cherry pie!$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.ChocolateOrange": "Aw, @! This is such a special treat, thank you. Let's split it and share.$20",
"Val.GiftReaction.AetheriteBar": "Nobody knows more than me how difficult this is to get. I'll make it into chainmail rings, that way I feel like you're protecting me.$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.FlareEssence": "Oh, sweet. Thanks @, I'll make great use of this - can never have enough Flare Essence as an Artificer.$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.HoneyOldFashioned": "This is the good stuff. My favorite part of an Old Fashioned is the citrus garnish - can't do without the peel or the cherry!$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.CitrusCityGinSour": "Drinking an egg white might sound a little odd at first, but it really elevates the taste and makes for something fancy.$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.ZuzuMule": "Oh, you can tell this was made with an all-important splash of love. Thank you, @.$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.CalicoWhiskey": "I don't turn my nose down at whiskey, no matter how low to the ground the bottle is.$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.GotoranCoffee": "Black as hell, strong as death, and sweet as love - this looks perfect, @, what a treat!$26",
"Val.GiftReaction.FakePhoto": "Two-Time Award winnin- oh, I think this is a knockoff, @.$27",
"Val.GiftReaction.GenuinePhoto": "Oh wow, you got Rodney's signature? This is so cool, I love his books. Thanks, @!$26",
"Val.GiftReaction.AppleCider": "Cider is one of my favorite non-alcoholic drinks! Thank you for thinking of me, @.$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.CrabRangoons": "I hate crabs, so I love when they're crushed up and shoved into a wonton wrapper. Thank you, @!$26",
"Val.GiftReaction.CrabDip": "Oh, wow! I thought this was an East Coast thing. They have so many fun and unique ways to murder crabs, they must hate them as much as I do.$26",
"Val.GiftReaction.CrabRoll": "The more food we figure out how to shove crabs into, the better. This looks delicious, thanks @.$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.CrabandCallaloo": "I see that crab-hatred is universal, even from far off places like the Fern Islands. Thanks, @!$26 ",
"Val.GiftReaction.PumpkinBite": "Oh this is so cute. I almost don't want to eat it, but I'm going to anyway. Thanks, @.$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.TresLechesCake": "This was my favorite thing to get as a treat when I was in school. It's so nostalgic; thanks for sharing, @.$25",
"Val.GiftReaction.EgusiSoup": "Pumpkin soup-? No, better! This looks delicious, thank you @!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.SeafoodBoil": "Ah-ha, all manner of causation are gathered here today, for a meeting about to take place in my stomach...$31",
// GIFT REACTIONS: LIKES 
"Val.GiftReaction.Pumpkin": "These are my favorite! Nothing beats carving a Jack o Lantern in the Fall. And besides that, they're tasty.$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.PumpkinSoup": "Pumpkin tastes so good, I'll eat it in any form. Thank you, @. $1",
"Val.GiftReaction.Coffee": "That's a damn fine cup of coffee, @. Thank you.$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.CoffeeBean": "Thanks, @. I'm sure I'll make a delicious cup of coffee with one singular bean.$17",
"Val.GiftReaction.AlcoholBasic": "I'll drink to you any day of the week, @. Cheers!$26",
"Val.GiftReaction.FerskenPeachMead": "Oh, is this from the Bear Family? They make the BEST mead, thank you! I'll try and have some self-control.$31",
"Val.GiftReaction.FerskenPeachPotentMead": "This smells like it'll strip off my stomach lining. But, hey, it's worth a try, right?$27",
"Val.GiftReaction.Ingot": "This is so helpful, @! I'll be sure to put it to good use, make something cool. Thank you!$26",
"Val.GiftReaction.Ore": "This is so helpful, @! You can never have enough ore to smelt. Thank you!$26",
"Val.GiftReaction.Seashells": "I love collecting shells off the sand, and I'm glad you do too - I keep all the cute ones I find. Thanks for adding to my collection.$4",
"Val.GiftReaction.BeachForage": "I love finding cool stuff on the beach - I keep bits of driftwood, coral, and shell in my desk. Thank you, @.$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.EnDForage": "This is a really fancy coral! I love it. Maybe I'll collect enough to impress Dylan someday.$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.FancyApple": "Perfect for Fall, @! Can't do without a fanciful apple treat. Thank you.$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.CandiedOrangePeel": "Oh, I adore orange peel. Mostly with whiskey. Here's a treat in exchange!#$action AddItem (O)DN.SnS_ChocolateOrange",
"Val.GiftReaction.Pecan": "Pecan is delicious and I'll eat anything that has it. Thank you, @!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.Marshmallow": "Marshmallows are what the Summer tastes like. Thank you, @!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.Horchata": "Oh, this reminds me of my time in the Fern Islands... Lots of interesting drinks there. Thanks, @!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.FriedPlantains": "Oh, this reminds me of my time in the Fern Islands... lots of interesting food there. Thanks, @!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.Churros": "Oh, this reminds me of my time in the Fern Islands... lots of interesting dessert there. Thanks, @!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.AcornBread": "I love the nutty flavor of Acorn Bread, it's really autumnal. Thank you for sharing with me, @!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.Smore": "Nothing beats a S'more in the Summer! An open fire, a few good friends... this is what nostalgia tastes like. Thanks, @!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.HomemadePopcorn": "Flavacol is what makes popcorn taste so good... And you can get it anywhere and add it at home!$1",
"Val.GiftReaction.HotChocolate": "Hot Chocolate is second only to fancy mulled cider. Thank you, @!$1",
// GIFT REACTIONS: HATES 
"Val.GiftReaction.StygiumOre": "@! You can't just hand this to someone. It's poisonous! #$action AddItem (O)DN.SnS_StygiumOre",
"Val.GiftReaction.Crab": "I hate crabs. They trek sand everywhere, and they're a menace to East Scarp.$6#$b#The only thing they're good for is having their meat dunked in garlic butter.$7",
// GIFT REACTIONS: ARTIFACTS
"Val.GiftReaction.DwarfScrolls": "Dwarvish is a rich, complex language. Having these scrolls accessible to everyone is invaluable so that more people can learn.$26 [96]",
