// ROMANTIC ITEM REJECTIONS 
"Val.GiftRejection.Bouquet": "%Val is not interested in a Bouquet. Maybe you can show your interest in a different way...",
"Val.GiftRejection.MermaidPendant": "%Val is not interested in getting married until the mystery of the Deep Dark is resolved.",
// MOVIES
"Val.BraveLittleSapling.1": "Oh, this seems like it'll be very cute.$25",
"Val.BraveLittleSapling.2": "Follow your dreams, Little Sapling. I know you can do it.$1",
"Val.BraveLittleSapling.3": "He did his best and achieved his goals, I'm very proud of him.$20",
"Val.NaturalWonders.1": "I'm glad you appreciate this sort of thing. I do, too.$0",
"Val.NaturalWonders.2": "I find it very unfair that animals seem to be proportionally cute to how dangerous they are.$24",
"Val.NaturalWonders.3": "I just think it's really unfair that petting non-domesticated animals is a health hazard.$29",
"Val.PrairieKing.1": "I love westerns, and I'm a HUGE fan of the Prairie King video game, so this is a dream come true.$16",
"Val.PrairieKing.2": "Cowboys are so cool. Is it too late to change professions?$18",
"Val.PrairieKing.3": "When's the next showing? I'd watch it again! That was perfect, everything I could have wanted.$4",
"Val.Wumbus.1": "Hm. Sci-Fi isn't usually my thing.$6",
"Val.Wumbus.2": "I'm warming up to this, actually.$0",
"Val.Wumbus.3": "If anything happens to Wumbus in the sequel I will not hesitate to commit crimes in his name.$5",
"Val.Mysterium.1": "This is one of my favorites, actually. I'm always glad for them to re-run it. I watch the series it's from at least once a year.$1",
"Val.Mysterium.2": "The director was a real oddball, but his work is nuanced and strange in a way I really enjoy.$25",
"Val.Mysterium.3": "'Through the darkness of future past, the magician longs to see. One chants out between two worlds: Fire. Walk. With. Me.'$32",
"Val.ItHowlsInTheRain.1": "The title sounds familiar... maybe I've seen this before?$29",
"Val.ItHowlsInTheRain.2": "Oh, nope, that was definitely a different 'Howl' movie!$3",
"Val.ItHowlsInTheRain.3": "Could've sworn this was a cute animated fantasy flick, but I was very wrong...$27",
"Val.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.1": "The posters make this seem like it was produced by a greeting card company.$29",
"Val.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.2": "I'm not really into the whole holiday warmth trope... It makes me kinda jealous that I don't feel the same way.$24",
"Val.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.3": "Definitely not my thing, but I'd be happy to see another one with you sometime.$25",
"Val.ZuzuCityExpress.1": "Oh, I love a good romantic tragedy. Especially one based on a stage show.$0",
"Val.ZuzuCityExpress.2": "The train makes for a pretty interesting metaphor...$22",
"Val.ZuzuCityExpress.3": "An excellent story, but I didn't realize how dour the ending would be.$24",
// EGG FESTIVAL 
"Val.spring13.False.1": "Love a good egg hunt. I used to help hide them, but some of them wouldn't get found until they started to smell.$27",
"Val.spring13.False.2": "Rooting for you, @. I used to be really good at this when Lewis still let me play as a kid. Not so much, now.$1",
"Val.spring13.False.3": "Gus really cooked up a storm, huh? There's like, every kind of egg imaginable here, cooked every which way.$26",
"Val.spring13.True.1": "Okay, so. There's one behind that tree right there. And another just out of sight under the bush.$14#$b#Ah, shoot, Lewis is looking over here. Good luck, Sunshine.$17",
"Val.spring13.True.2": "See, I'm more into cooperative play. I should be allowed to help you without Lewis getting all bent out of shape.$23",
"Val.spring13.True.3": "I love you win or lose, Sunshine. But you know that, so, have fun kicking ass.$32",
// FLOWER DANCE 
"Val.spring24.False.1": "Dated a tradition as this is, I can still appreciate it. Honestly, I love any reason to get dressed to dance.$25",
"Val.spring24.False.2": "Generally I prefer loud music and close quarters, but getting a chance to spend time with everyone is always nice.$20 ",
"Val.spring24.False.3": "I don't think this shade of blue really... suits me, @.$17",
"Val.spring24.True.1": "When I see you all dressed up, everything slows down and nobody else matters. It reminds me of our wedding day. Love you, @.$4",
"Val.spring24.True.2": "I love you so unreasonably, Sunshine. When you're all dressed up, it really makes me want to get you dressed right back down.$19",
"Val.spring24.True.3": "I have the privilege of falling in love again every time I get to dance with you, @.$4",
"Val.spring24.Accept": "I'd love to dance with you, @. Thank you for asking.$25",
// LUAU 
"Val.summer11.False.1": "I love seeing everyone gathered together. Makes it feel like a real tight-knit community. Really, that's the magic of food, drink and dance.$1",
"Val.summer11.False.2": "I'm still stuck on how the soup doesn't taste like a disaster. Maybe it's just... the power of friendship, or something?$29",
"Val.summer11.False.3": "I brought just a little bit of Fairy Rose Honey to share. If the soup tastes weird, I don't want it to be pinned on me.$27",
"Val.summer11.True.1": "Honestly, surviving the soup every year - especially with this many people throwing stuff in - seems like a challenge. Well, if we get sick, you and I are going down together.$17",
"Val.summer11.True.2": "All this food makes me want to take a nap. Looking forward to curling up for one with you, Sunshine.$4",
"Val.summer11.True.3": "I love when it's hot out like this. Sun's out, guns out - and, hey, I'm happy to provide a view for the love of my life.$25",
// MOONLIGHT JELLIES
"Val.summer28.False.1": "I love the jellies. There's a type of them in the Fern Islands that sting something nasty, though. So, you don't want to go swimming too much when they're around.$29",
"Val.summer28.False.2": "The water looks amazing when these little guys glow, doesn't it? I get a great view from outside my door, but it's so much better spending the night together with everyone.$1",
"Val.summer28.False.3": "I swear, there was something in the water that wasn't a jellyfish...$29",
"Val.summer28.True.1": "I never would've thought I'd have the chance to stand here together and watch this happen. The way the lights are reflecting off you is one of the most beautiful things I've ever seen.$4",
"Val.summer28.True.2": "Nothing sounds better than holding you and watching the Lunaloos do their thing. The valley is such a beautiful place, but more so with you in it.$4",
"Val.summer28.True.3": "I've seen plenty of beaches at this point - but none of them see this phenomenon. It's such a treat to share in it with you, Sunshine.$4",
// SDV FAIR
"Val.fall16.False.1": "Tch, that bell didn't stand a chance! I'm sorry, I couldn't hear you over the sound of these guns.$17#$b#%Val playfully flexes.",
"Val.fall16.False.2": "You're talking to the several-year bell ringing champion, @. Swinging a sword around all the time does the body a whole lotta good.$26",
"Val.fall16.False.3": "I'm inclined to strength and dexterity due to being a Troll, but Lewis doesn't have to know. I've already grown out of the egg hunt, let me have this.$29",
"Val.fall16.True.1": "You've got this in the bag, Sunshine. I'll win the strength contest, you'll win the display competition - and then we'll both go home and celebrate.$31",
"Val.fall16.True.2": "The strength game was the journey, but being strong enough to manhandle you is the prize.$23",
"Val.fall16.True.3": "If there was darts or axe throwing, I'd nail that almost as well as I nail you! Hey, stop laughing-$27",
// SPIRIT'S EVE
"Val.fall27.False.1": "Tonight's the one night during the year where it's okay not to feel safe. You should want to be a little bit scared.$33#$b#If you don't survive being scared when you're young, how are you going to handle it when you're older? There's so much more to be afraid of later in life.$33",
"Val.fall27.False.2": "Don't ever smash a Jack o' Lantern or steal a kid's candy. Tonight is about respecting the dead, because this is the one night that they, and all sorts of other things, roam free.$33#$b#All these traditions? The Jack o' Lantern, the costumes, handing out treats... they were all started to protect you.$33",
"Val.fall27.False.3": "Not going to lie, this costume is a little on the itchy side... and it's kind of tough to stay in-character.$33",
"Val.fall27.True.1": "I just want to be, want to bewitch you, in the moonlight~$33",
"Val.fall27.True.2": "There's a darkness at the heart of my love for you, that runs cold, and runs deep~$33",
"Val.fall27.True.3": "I'll be the shadow, you be the light. We will go softly into the night~$33",
// ICE FESTIVAL 
"Val.winter8.False.1": "%Val is patting down a snowball to perfection.#$b#Alright, Marlon... if you can dodge a monster's attack, you can dodge a snowball.$32",
"Val.winter8.False.2": "There's an old movie I really like, about how the snow came to be. A man with shears for hands carves ice sculptures, and the flurries result in our storms. This festival reminds me of that.$1",
"Val.winter8.False.3": "It's pretty tough to be out in the cold like this sometimes, but being around friends does make it a lot easier.$25",
"Val.winter8.True.1": "I was going to selfishly suggest sneaking off, but I know you're having a good time. I'll just have to warm up with you later.$31",
"Val.winter8.True.2": "On a scale of 'no longer married' to 'strengthened marriage', how mad would you be if I tried to get Lewis to have a snowball fight competition instead of a fishing competition?$23",
"Val.winter8.True.3": "I love you enough to let you know that you're not free of potentially getting hit with a snowball just because we're married.$17#$b#The conditions were 'till death do us part', not 'until my darling partner pelts me with snow'. Watch out.$32",
// WINTER STAR 
"Val.winter25.False.1": "When I was a kid, Marlon got me my first sword as a gift. Lewis was pissed, but I'd say he was a really diligent and responsible teacher. $17",
"Val.winter25.False.2": "The food, the gifts, the company - nothing beats this, really. Especially when Winter is otherwise such a bummer.$1",
"Val.winter25.False.3": "This festival is usually when I'd be given new adventuring gear when I was younger, and now I'm paying it all back to Marlon and Gunther with custom gear$25.",
"Val.winter25.True.1": "This festival makes it really easy to feel like I'm part of something real, something substantial.$4#$b#%Val kisses the tip of your nose.",
"Val.winter25.True.2": "The holidays are better because I get to spend them with you, Sunshine. Winter would be neigh unbearable otherwise.$25",
"Val.winter25.True.3": "I've got a gift for later, @. It involves two things: Indulgence on my end, and satisfaction on yours.$19",
// RSV GATHERING 
"Val.fall20.False.1": "It's cool to watch everyone compete, but I wasn't sure which team to be on. Instead, I'm just gonna keep the ol' man company.$9",
"Val.fall20.False.2": "The show tonight will be excellent, I'm sure.$1",
"Val.fall20.False.3": "The food here is really good, the competition is just a little awkward for me though.$27",
"Val.fall20.True.1": "Would you want to split off and explore the woods with me, Sunshine?$4",
"Val.fall20.True.2": "Sorry, I'm just thinking of all the neat places we could go up here. Lots of little hidden corners.$16",
"Val.fall20.True.3": "The mountain air must be getting to my head or something... I love being up here, especially with you.$25",
// RSV EMBER OF RESOLUTIONS 
"Val.winter28.False.1": "Change is a series of choices, made over time. You don't have to be the person you were yesterday if you don't want to.$25",
"Val.winter28.False.2": "Tell the fire who you want to be, and the ashes in the wind will set you free.$20",
"Val.winter28.False.3": "'When this kind of fire starts, it is very hard to put out. The tender boughs of innocence burn first, and the wind rises, and then all goodness is in jeopardy...'$6",
"Val.winter28.True.1": "You helped me change. Make the right choices. Grow. Thank you for that, Sunshine. I love and appreciate you.$25",
"Val.winter28.True.2": "I love you, @. Let's leap forward into the next year together!$1",
"Val.winter28.True.3": "This is simply a change, not an end...$25",
// CONVERSATION TOPICS 
"Val.CT.ValIntro": "Hey, @. I was trying to think of a joke about our Stygium Crab encounter, but it didn't have legs. In fact, it was outright clawful.$17", 
"Val.CT.ValLibrary": "I swear I saw the Pepper Rex egg moving, so I've been very eager to get home the past few days.$26", 
"Val.CT.ValMuseumIntro": "Wonder who was brave enough to wield that Stygium sword before I found it. Couldn't have gone over well for their health...$6", 
"Val.CT.ValAwkwardEncounter": "Yeah, I - I have a history with Marlon and Gunther, I just... haven't been doing a great job at maintaining that relationship.$27", 
"Val.CT.ValFlashOfGenius": "So much to do. I need to upgrade the forge, get some more coal, do some reading on the potential side-effects... not that anything with Stygium is well-documented.$7", 
"Val.CT.ValAetheriteIntro": "We did it, @! Stygium can be purified! This is such a breakthrough, thank you for contributing.$16", 
"Val.CT.ValInjury": "Thank you, again, for patching me up. My eye is pretty messed up, but it could be a lot worse. Lesson learned.$25", 
"Val.CT.ValCoffeeHangout": "It feels so good to finally be on the level with Gunther and Marlon again, like I've got my friends back.$26", 
"Val.CT.EmeritusIntro": "Between reuniting with Gunther and Marlon, and Emeritus being born - I really understand I have to tone down my risk-taking. Thank you for sticking with me through this all, @.$25", 
"Val.CT.ValConfides": "@, thank you for sitting with me. It was really nice to hear about what you've got going on and just spend some quiet time together.$25", 
"Val.CT.ValMinibossBattle": "I acknowledge the Deep Dark is a problem I can't handle alone. I feel responsible for East Scarp, but we know a bunch of other capable people who can help.$28",

}